### 3. Submit Normal Transaction (Idempotent)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: manual-test-001

{
  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-1001",
  "amount": 450000.00,
  "currency": "IDR",
  "txType": "PAYMENT",
  "merchantName": "Fore Coffee Sudirman",
  "merchantCategory": "FNB",
  "countryCode": "IDN",
  "city": "Jakarta",
  "latitude": -6.2146,
  "longitude": 106.8211,
  "deviceId": "DEV-A1",
  "ipAddress": "103.10.1.11"
}

